  "summary": "Align Recon with the current ontology and migration protocols and add an expandable Windows CI profile.",
  "why": "Recon now consumes the ontology registry's immutable source closure and a migration-aware ledger verifier instead of reconstructing ontology provenance or selecting migration evidence independently. The governed documentation and CI contracts must record the same integration boundary and validation coverage."
